WEBVTT

00:03:56.638 --> 00:04:00.831
We developed strict rules
on how to engage with each other

00:04:00.855 --> 00:04:03.085
with food, with hair,

00:04:03.109 --> 00:04:05.044
with birth, with death,

00:04:05.068 --> 00:04:07.438
with marriage and procreation.

00:04:07.968 --> 00:04:11.929
Some of the symbols
have eerie commonalities.

00:04:12.315 --> 00:04:17.842
The hand of God shows up
over and over and over again.

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:21.791
It shows up as the hamsa hand
in Mesopotamia.

00:04:21.815 --> 00:04:25.234
It shows us as the hand
of Fatima in Islam.

00:04:25.258 --> 00:04:28.840
It shows up as the hand
of Miriam in Judaism.

00:04:28.864 --> 00:04:34.569
Now, when we didn't agree
on what our beliefs and behaviors were